1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,100
In qamatis sa'ah, apabila berlaku kiamat.

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:08,340
In qamat 'ala ahadikumul qiyamah,

3
00:00:08,340 --> 00:00:10,930
sekiranya berlaku pada seseorang

4
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:11,940
kamu kiamat.

5
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,930
Wa fi yadihi fasilah, sedangkan di

6
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:17,340
tangannya ada benih.

7
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:23,459
Fasilah ni macam pokok benih, anak pokok.

8
00:00:23,472 --> 00:00:24,672
Falyaghrisha,

9
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:26,620
tanam.

10
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,540
Sekiranya berlaku kiamat.

11
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:35,210
Bila kiamat berlaku,

12
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,500
sempat lagi nak menanam ke?

13
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,620
Tak dah, dan menanam.

14
00:00:39,620 --> 00:00:40,420
Kiamat.

15
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:45,520
Kita berlaku goncangan, gempa bumi,

16
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:46,700
bertempiaran lari.

17
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:47,940
Tinggal semua benda.

18
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,500
Ini kiamat yang Allah telah sebut,

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,181
yauma yafirrul mar'u min akhihi, wa

20
00:00:54,181 --> 00:00:57,220
ummihi wa abihi, wa sahibatihi wa banih.

21
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:59,290
Pada hari di mana seseorang itu

22
00:00:59,290 --> 00:01:02,220
akan lari daripada saudara dia,

23
00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:06,890
ibu dia, ayah dia, isteri dia,

24
00:01:06,890 --> 00:01:09,420
dan anak-anak dia.

25
00:01:09,420 --> 00:01:11,530
Bila kita ambil keadaan kat situ,

26
00:01:11,530 --> 00:01:13,580
yang paling disayang anak.

27
00:01:13,580 --> 00:01:15,460
Maka Allah sebut hak hujung sekali,

28
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:17,820
hak dia sayang sekali, anak, tinggal juga.

29
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:20,800
Lepas pada anak dia sayang bini,

30
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,060
bini pun dia tinggal juga.

31
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:24,160
Lepas sayang bini, dia sayang ayah,

32
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,700
ayah dia pun dia tinggal juga.

33
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:28,307
Lepas ayah dia, adik-beradik dia pun

34
00:01:28,307 --> 00:01:29,140
dia tinggal belakang.

35
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:31,660
Bila kiamat, dan kalau itu keadaan

36
00:01:31,660 --> 00:01:34,270
semua bakal lari belakang, tak akan

37
00:01:34,270 --> 00:01:36,220
sempat nak pergi menanam, tak sempat dah.

38
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:40,520
Tapi Islam mengajar, kalau dikira

39
00:01:40,520 --> 00:01:42,660
ada benih, tanam.

40
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:43,860
Hadis

41
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:49,350
yang Nabi sebut, tidak menunjukkan

42
00:01:49,350 --> 00:01:51,920
yang akan berlaku, tapi mubalaghah,

43
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:53,620
satu kesungguhan.

44
00:01:53,620 --> 00:01:56,250
Nak beritahu, kalau kiamat pun Nabi

45
00:01:56,250 --> 00:01:58,580
suruh tanam, hak tak kiamat apatah lagi?
